    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nagamba ati, “Oyatanguke, otakemelera iraka, oyatanguke nk'enzamba. Ogambire eihanga lyange Isiraeli entambara zalyo, ogambire eka ya Yakobo amafu gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibanfukamira buli kiro. Nibagamba okwo tulikugonza kumanya entwaza zange n'okuhulira Amateka gange, okw'obon'oti tuli ihanga eligorogoki, elitakachwaga migenzo ya Ruhanga walyo. Nibagamba okwo tulikugonza kambateraho Amateka garungi n'okwo tulikushemelerwa kunfukamira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibabaza bati, “Kubaki tusiibe? Orwo tulikusiiba Omukama nk'atalikutusiima? Twayeshasa, kyonkai ekyo talikukibonamu kantu!” Omukama nabahorora ati, “Omu mazima kamulikusiba, nimuba nimukora ebili byanyu, mara nimushasa abakozi banyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kusiiba kwanyu, nimugira obukatili, nimukungana, nimurwana. Okusiiba kwanyu okwa kakyo aka tikubarugiremu kutaka kwanyu kungoba kunu mw'iguru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo mulikusiiba, nimweletera obushasi. Nimubwarama ahansi nk'obunyasi, nimwara engunia, nimuzanjaraho eijwi nimulibyamamu. Okwo nikwo mulikweta okusiiba? Inywe nimulenga muti ebyo nibinshemelera? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okusiiba okwo ndikwenda nikw'oku: Mulekere kubonesa abantu enaku n'okubashasa, abo mutura mubonesa enaku mubaleke bagiire emilembe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaina enjara mubahe eby'okulya; abaanaku atulikubunga mubahe obuturo. Abataina kakujwara mubahe emyendo, kandi ab'amakwatane ganyu mutaburwa kubajuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ndibashemelerwa okw'obon'eizoba nilishabuka, n'amahuta ganyu galikira bwangu. Buli kanya ndiikara nainywe mbarokore, inye Omukama w'ekitinwa mbeme enyuma mtulinde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulinshaba mbahorore, kamulitaka ndibetabuka. Kamulilekera kubonesa banu enaku, mukalekera eikuru, mukalekera okugamba kubi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abajara mukabaha ebyakulya, mukashumbusha abaanaku, aho omwilima oguliba gubazingoire gulihinduka mushana gw'eihangwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndibahabura buli kanya, mbahe n'ebintu ebirungi. Ndibaha amani n'emilembe. Mulishusha ebusitani y'amaizi gangi, mulishusha enchuro etayomera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isiraeli alyombeka buhya amaju agakambukire, ashube ayombeke aha misingi yonene yonene eya karai. Mulimanyika okwo ni inywe mwayombekire buhya enkuta z'eboma n'amaju agakambukire mukagaturamu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nagamba ati, “Kamulilekera kuhagaza ekiro kya Sabato, mukalekera kukora emilimo aha kiro kyange ekitakatifu, mara mukamanya okwo kili kiro kitakatifu mukakikunisa mutagizire ngendo, mutakozire milimo, anga kusiba mu fumoro za katozi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aho mulibona okwo okunkolera kurugwamu ebyera. Ndibaha ekitinwa omu nsi yona, n'ensi eyo nahaire Yakobo shw'nkurw'inywe, eliba yanyu. Alikugamba n'inye Omukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
